  "articleBodyHtml": "<h2>Gratitude and Appreciation</h2>\n<p>Participants expressed gratitude for the tournament and the assets provided, with several thanking the organizers and Holo Ina for their contributions.</p>\n<p>The organizers expressed gratitude for the logo commissioning and thanked everyone for joining the event, expressing a desire to repeat it in the future.</p>\n<p>Participants and organizers alike found the situation sweet and expressed pleasure, particularly in the cooperation with Ina.</p>\n<h2>Goals and Aspirations</h2>\n<p>Several participants expressed a desire to improve their skills and compete against Ina, with one stating that their primary goal was to go against Ina.</p>\n<p>Participants also expressed a hope to achieve victory against Ina, recognizing it as a significant accomplishment, although one participant downplayed the significance of such a win.</p>\n<h2>Event Organization and Challenges</h2>\n<p>Organizing events across different time zones was noted as a significant challenge, though the organizers were thankful for the effort put into commissioning the logo and other event details.</p>\n<p>Participants suggested that shoutcasting could be an alternative to in-person collaborations due to the difficulty of coordinating across busy schedules and time zones.</p>\n<h2>Community and Collaboration</h2>\n<p>The Polo Council was mentioned as providing a more flexible structure for collaborations, eliminating the need for strict relaying of information.</p>\n<p>The primary goal of the event was to foster a sense of community among fans of Holo IA and Holo ID, with participants expressing happiness and a sense of belonging.</p>\n<h2>Closing Remarks and Future Plans</h2>\n<p>The speaker concluded the event with a closing remark and a reminder to care for their &#x27;golden yagos&#x27;, while expressing a willingness to repeat the event in the future.</p>\n<p>Participants expressed excitement and a desire to repeat the event, with some even expressing a willingness to join again whenever possible.</p>\n<h2>Additional Notes</h2>\n<p>Participants were encouraged to use hats and cards in future Mario Kart streams, and there was a brief mention of KFP and Taco Bell working well together with Ina&#x27;s involvement.</p>\n<h2>記事情報</h2>\n<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fgakXTZdtvo</p>",
